    "synopsis": {
        "native": "A m\u00e1sf\u00e9l \u00f3r\u00e1s kreat\u00edv, szocio - dokumentumfilm azt mutatja be, milyen volt a rendszerv\u00e1ltoz\u00e1s el\u0151tt Magyarorsz\u00e1gon meleg f\u00e9rfik\u00e9nt \u00e9lni. A t\u00e9m\u00e1nak n\u00e9gy fiatal meleg sr\u00e1c ered a nyom\u00e1ba. H\u00e9t id\u0151s meleg f\u00e9rfi szem\u00e9lyes \u00e9lm\u00e9nyei, a kik\u00e9rt titkosszolg\u00e1lati akt\u00e1k, a mai t\u00e1rsadalmi \u00e9s jogi k\u00f6rnyezet t\u00fckr\u00e9ben \u00e9rtelmezik az elm\u00falt 50 \u00e9vet.",
        "english": "Four young gay guys investigate how Hungarian society and the state have been treating gays and how gays' personal experiences of social and political oppression have changed since Communism until today."
